## Appendix A — Roadmap Toward STIX/TAXII Integration

The framework mappings in this report (MITRE ATT&CK technique IDs, IOC lists, observed
patterns) are structurally compatible with the STIX 2.1 data model. A future iteration
of {{ system_name }} could emit `Indicator`, `Observed-Data`, and `Threat-Actor` STIX
objects for consumption by OpenCTI or MISP, enabling correlation of this deployment's
observations with wider industry threat feeds.

